###  https://w3id.org/citydata/part2/v1/Contact#Camp
contact:Camp rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
             rdfs:label "CP"@en ,
                        "Camp"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/citydata/part2/v1/Contact#Campus
